<h2>Asset Reuse and Security</h2>

<h3>We do not build it from scratch</h3>
<p>We start the PoC by cloning the features already provided by the <strong>Reference Wiki</strong> that is running for pre-validation (the very wiki explained by the <a href="#!kgs-overview">How Knowledge Accumulates</a> series), and we grow the validated features into the company platform. Scope proven as of 2026-07: HTML Fragment documents, SPA Web UI, JSON Navigation Tree (immutable IDs separated from physical paths), unified/Tag/Concept search, Knowledge Index (deterministic build + <code>--check</code> drift gate), automatic related-document recommendation (<code>related</code>) and <strong>five typed knowledge relations (<code>relations</code>)</strong>, Knowledge Map · 3D/2D knowledge graph, <strong>an AI consumption layer (llms.txt · self-contained graph JSON)</strong>, a four-layer CI validation gate, Work Log, and Git History based document history.</p>

<p>Reuse here is not merely "referring to the code." This engine is already <strong>packaged as wiki-plugin (v0.21.0)</strong> — it carries 18 registration/index/validation tools and 4 skills (add-doc · index · validate · wiki-init), so installing it in a new repository instantly bootstraps the same knowledge system (<a href="#!kgs-plugin">Packaging the Wiki Engine as a Plugin</a>). The Reference Wiki itself runs as the first dogfooding user of this plugin, so "we do not build it from scratch" is not a slogan but an <strong>installation procedure</strong>.</p>

<p>In particular, in this Reference Wiki, <strong>reflecting the knowledge system is mandated as a rule whenever AI writes or edits a document</strong> (enforced by the repository's AI guideline document). When a single document is added, navigation registration → knowledge index entry (including concepts and a <strong>multi-angle review of the five relation types</strong> — a missed review is surfaced by a non-blocking review signal) → deterministic index build → automatic reflection in the knowledge map, graph, and search → Work Log record all move together within the <strong>same unit of change (PR)</strong>. In other words, the company platform's operating discipline of a "knowledge reflection rate" is already being validated at small scale.</p>

